# A body truncated by @timeout must fail the request, not pass as a success.
# /stall sends Content-Length 1000, writes 10 bytes, then stalls.

exitcode 1 hitspec run stall.http
stdout 'stall-request'
stdout 'timeout reading response body after 500ms \(read 10 of 1000 bytes\)'
stdout 'Tests: 1 failed, 1 total'

-- stall.http --
### stall-request
# @timeout 500
GET {{$env(SERVER)}}/stall

>>>
expect status 200
<<<
